   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "What comes out well or badly",
     "texto": [
      "With **찍히다** you say that something comes out in a photo: 찍다 → **찍혔어요** (it came out). It is also used to say that someone was caught or stepped on: 잡다 → **잡혔어요** (was caught), 밟다 → **밟혔어요** (was stepped on).",
      "사진이 잘 **찍혔어요** = the photo came out well."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Past",
     "texto": [
      "The past form is made like that of the normal verb, with **-았/었어요**: 찍히다 → 찍혔어요, 잡히다 → 잡혔어요, 밟히다 → 밟혔어요.",
      "발을 **밟혔어요** = someone stepped on my foot."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
